---
title: Create
---

{% extends "layouts/base.layout.njk" %}
{% block content %}
    <section class="mg-create-hero" aria-labelledby="monogame-create">
        <div class="container-xxl mg-create-hero-inner">
            <div class="mg-create-hero-copy">
                <p class="mg-home-feature-kicker">Build with MonoGame</p>
                <h1 id="monogame-create">Start making something playable, fast.</h1>
                <p class="mg-create-hero-body">
                    Whether you are brand new to game development or a seasoned coder exploring new territory,
                    MonoGame gives you a flexible framework to turn ideas into working games. This page collects
                    starter kits, demos, and learning paths that help you build momentum quickly.
                </p>
                <div class="mg-home-hero-actions mg-create-hero-actions">
                    <a class="btn btn-lg mg-button mg-home-hero-primary" href="https://docs.monogame.net/articles/tutorials/index.html">
                        <i class="bi bi-mortarboard" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>Explore Tutorials</span>
                    </a>
                    <a class="btn btn-lg mg-outline-button mg-home-hero-secondary" href="https://github.com/MonoGame/MonoGame.Samples">
                        <i class="bi bi-github" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <span>Browse Samples</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container-xxl mg-create-section" aria-labelledby="monogame-getstarted">
        <div class="mg-home-feature-card mg-create-callout">
            <div class="mg-create-callout-copy">
                <p class="mg-home-feature-kicker">Code-first setup</p>
                <h2 id="monogame-getstarted">Templates for your editor of choice</h2>
                <p>
                    MonoGame works smoothly with Visual Studio, VS Code, Rider, and direct `dotnet` workflows.
                    The built-in templates cover MonoGame’s supported platforms so you can go from install to first run
                    without wrestling your setup.
                </p>
                <p>
                    For a deeper guided path, head to the
                    <a href="https://docs.monogame.net/articles/tutorials/index.html">Tutorials section</a>
                    for 2D and 3D starter walkthroughs.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mg-create-callout-links" aria-label="Code-first links">
                <a class="mg-create-inline-link hide-external-icon" href="https://docs.monogame.net/articles/getting_started/index.html">
                    <span>Installation guides</span>
                    <svg class="mg-home-news-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M15.1999 10.4899L13.2299 8.51993L10.0199 5.30993C9.33993 4.63993 8.17993 5.11993 8.17993 6.07993V12.3099V17.9199C8.17993 18.8799 9.33993 19.3599 10.0199 18.6799L15.1999 13.4999C16.0299 12.6799 16.0299 11.3199 15.1999 10.4899Z" />
                    </svg>
                </a>
                <a class="mg-create-inline-link hide-external-icon" href="https://docs.monogame.net/articles/tutorials/index.html">
                    <span>2D and 3D tutorials</span>
                    <svg class="mg-home-news-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M15.1999 10.4899L13.2299 8.51993L10.0199 5.30993C9.33993 4.63993 8.17993 5.11993 8.17993 6.07993V12.3099V17.9199C8.17993 18.8799 9.33993 19.3599 10.0199 18.6799L15.1999 13.4999C16.0299 12.6799 16.0299 11.3199 15.1999 10.4899Z" />
                    </svg>
                </a>
                <a class="mg-create-inline-link hide-external-icon" href="https://github.com/MonoGame/MonoGame.Samples">
                    <span>GitHub sample repo</span>
                    <svg class="mg-home-news-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M15.1999 10.4899L13.2299 8.51993L10.0199 5.30993C9.33993 4.63993 8.17993 5.11993 8.17993 6.07993V12.3099V17.9199C8.17993 18.8799 9.33993 19.3599 10.0199 18.6799L15.1999 13.4999C16.0299 12.6799 16.0299 11.3199 15.1999 10.4899Z" />
                    </svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container-xxl mg-create-section" aria-labelledby="starterkits">
        <div class="mg-create-section-header">
            <p class="mg-create-kicker">Starter kits</p>
            <h2 id="starterkits">Projects you can open and build on</h2>
            <p>
                Quickly set up your first game project with kits built around real gameplay foundations. Each one is
                meant to get you moving fast, not leave you staring at a blank project.
            </p>
            <p>Keep checking back, more starter kits are on the way.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mg-create-grid mg-create-grid--compact">
            <a href="https://github.com/MonoGame/MonoGame.Samples/blob/3.8.4/Platformer2D/README.md" class="mg-create-card hide-external-icon">
                <div class="mg-create-card-media"
                     style="background-image: url('/images/create/starter-kit-2d.png'); background-size: 100% 100%; background-position: center;"></div>
                <div class="mg-create-card-body">
                    <div class="mg-create-card-meta">
                        <span class="mg-home-news-tag">Starter kit</span>
                        <span>2D</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3><i class="bi bi-files" aria-hidden="true"></i> 2D Platformer Starter Kit</h3>
                    <p>A complete 2D starter kit based on the original XNA sample, extended for MonoGame.</p>
                    <span class="mg-home-news-read">
                        <span>Open kit</span>
                        <svg class="mg-home-news-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                            <path d="M15.1999 10.4899L13.2299 8.51993L10.0199 5.30993C9.33993 4.63993 8.17993 5.11993 8.17993 6.07993V12.3099V17.9199C8.17993 18.8799 9.33993 19.3599 10.0199 18.6799L15.1999 13.4999C16.0299 12.6799 16.0299 11.3199 15.1999 10.4899Z" />
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <a href="/blog/2025-07-16-3d-starter-kit" class="mg-create-card hide-external-icon">
                <div class="mg-create-card-media"
                     style="background-image: url('/images/create/starter-kit-3d.png'); background-size: 100% 100%; background-position: center;"></div>
                <div class="mg-create-card-body">
                    <div class="mg-create-card-meta">
                        <span class="mg-home-news-tag">Starter kit</span>
                        <span>3D</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3><i class="bi bi-files" aria-hidden="true"></i> 3D Platformer Starter Kit</h3>
                    <p>A complete 3D platformer starter kit featuring Kenny's assets and a stronger 3D foundation.</p>
                    <span class="mg-home-news-read">
                        <span>Read more</span>
                        <svg class="mg-home-news-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                            <path d="M15.1999 10.4899L13.2299 8.51993L10.0199 5.30993C9.33993 4.63993 8.17993 5.11993 8.17993 6.07993V12.3099V17.9199C8.17993 18.8799 9.33993 19.3599 10.0199 18.6799L15.1999 13.4999C16.0299 12.6799 16.0299 11.3199 15.1999 10.4899Z" />
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container-xxl mg-create-section" aria-labelledby="demos">
        <div class="mg-create-section-header">
            <p class="mg-create-kicker">Demos</p>
            <h2 id="demos">Feature-focused experiments and showcases</h2>
            <p>
                Explore smaller samples that highlight specific MonoGame capabilities, from rendering and input to
                movement, effects, and game feel.
            </p>
            <p>Keep checking back, more demos are coming soon.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mg-create-grid mg-create-grid--single">
            <a href="/blog/2025-06-10-ascent-demo" class="mg-create-card hide-external-icon">
                <div class="mg-create-card-media"
                     style="background-image: url('/images/blog/Ascent.png'); background-size: contain; background-position: top;"></div>
                <div class="mg-create-card-body">
                    <div class="mg-create-card-meta">
                        <span class="mg-home-news-tag">Demo</span>
                        <span>3D shooter</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3><i class="bi bi-rocket-takeoff-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> Ascent Demo</h3>
                    <p>The Ascent demo is a space-shooter showcase designed to push atmosphere, motion, and 3D action.</p>
                    <span class="mg-home-news-read">
                        <span>Read more</span>
                        <svg class="mg-home-news-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                            <path d="M15.1999 10.4899L13.2299 8.51993L10.0199 5.30993C9.33993 4.63993 8.17993 5.11993 8.17993 6.07993V12.3099V17.9199C8.17993 18.8799 9.33993 19.3599 10.0199 18.6799L15.1999 13.4999C16.0299 12.6799 16.0299 11.3199 15.1999 10.4899Z" />
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container-xxl mg-create-section" aria-labelledby="resources">
        <div class="mg-create-section-header">
            <p class="mg-create-kicker">Resources</p>
            <h2 id="resources">Keep learning with community-built material</h2>
            <p>
                Alongside the official docs, the MonoGame community has built up a useful ecosystem of examples,
                articles, tools, and sample projects to help you keep going.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mg-create-grid">
            <a href="/resources" class="mg-create-card hide-external-icon">
                <div class="mg-create-card-media"
                     style="background-image: url('/images/create/MonoGame.png'); background-size: contain; background-position: top;"></div>
                <div class="mg-create-card-body">
                    <div class="mg-create-card-meta">
                        <span class="mg-home-news-tag">Resources</span>
                        <span>Community</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3><i class="bi bi-collection-play-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> Community Resources</h3>
                    <p>A curated list of MonoGame resources to help you build faster, learn more, and share useful tools.</p>
                    <span class="mg-home-news-read">
                        <span>Explore resources</span>
                        <svg class="mg-home-news-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                            <path d="M15.1999 10.4899L13.2299 8.51993L10.0199 5.30993C9.33993 4.63993 8.17993 5.11993 8.17993 6.07993V12.3099V17.9199C8.17993 18.8799 9.33993 19.3599 10.0199 18.6799L15.1999 13.4999C16.0299 12.6799 16.0299 11.3199 15.1999 10.4899Z" />
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <a href="https://github.com/MonoGame/MonoGame.samples" class="mg-create-card hide-external-icon">
                <div class="mg-create-card-media"
                     style="background-image: url('/images/create/MonoGame.png'); background-size: contain; background-position: top;"></div>
                <div class="mg-create-card-body">
                    <div class="mg-create-card-meta">
                        <span class="mg-home-news-tag">Samples</span>
                        <span>GitHub</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3><i class="bi bi-collection-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> MonoGame Samples</h3>
                    <p>Browse the sample collection and see how community projects and focused examples are put together.</p>
                    <span class="mg-home-news-read">
                        <span>Browse collection</span>
                        <svg class="mg-home-news-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                            <path d="M15.1999 10.4899L13.2299 8.51993L10.0199 5.30993C9.33993 4.63993 8.17993 5.11993 8.17993 6.07993V12.3099V17.9199C8.17993 18.8799 9.33993 19.3599 10.0199 18.6799L15.1999 13.4999C16.0299 12.6799 16.0299 11.3199 15.1999 10.4899Z" />
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container-xxl mb-5">
        {% include 'partials/_join_community_card.njk' %}
    </section>
{% endblock %}
